{"id":"59e96b6fa0700cc7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-quantifier-as-adjoint.md","title":"df-quantifier-as-adjoint","display":"df-quantifier-as-adjoint","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-quantifier-as-adjoint","aliases":["16-df-quantifier-as-adjoint","16-quantifier-as-adjoint"],"display":"df-quantifier-as-adjoint","depends_on":["[[16-df-general-quantifier]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-quantifier-as-adjoint"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-quantifier-as-adjoint</span><span>16-quantifier-as-adjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-as-adjoint"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>；采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a> 的伴随存在谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p\">\\(\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p\\)</span> 如下定义，不依赖游离的候选函子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}\\)</span> 的精确存在量词定义采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p(u)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p(u)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定具体见证时得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*\\dashv\\Pi_u\">\\(\\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*\\dashv\\Pi_u\\)</span>。存在这些伴随是结构性质，不能用未列入谓词参数的任意两个候选函子定义。来源为 Definition 1.9.4，p.97（PDF117）的伴随存在性部分；完整一般量词还要求相应 Beck–Chevalley。§9.2 讨论逻辑谓词与关系，不能作为此定义的直接来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-general-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化，$u:I\\to J$，$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$；采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]] 的伴随存在谓词。$\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p$ 如下定义，不依赖游离的候选函子。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}$ 的精确存在量词定义采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p(u)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*\\dashv\\Pi_u","display":false}],"bytes":1195,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-quantifier-as-adjoint|df-quantifier-as-adjoint]]"}],"outgoing":["ef7efb192e321ef0"]}